OL,3,GNEWSADad with MS targets half marathon
OL,4,Aworld record
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man from Liverpool has set himself
OL,7,Fthe challenge of breaking a Guinness
OL,8,FWorld Record for the fastest half
OL,9,Fmarathon run by a man with multiple
OL,10,Fsclerosis (MS).
OL,12,FFather-of-two David Price, 42, was
OL,13,Fdiagnosed with MS in 2018 after
OL,14,Fstarting to struggle with his balance
OL,15,Fand peripheral vision.
OL,17,FEight years on, Price is preparing to
OL,18,Fattempt the record at the Manchester
OL,19,FHalf Marathon, but admits to feeling
OL,20,Fnervous.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
