OL,3,GNEWSADad with MS targets half marathon
OL,4,Aworld record
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe current record is held by Chris
OL,7,FWhite, who achieved a time of 1 hour 30
OL,8,Fminutes and 46 seconds in Brighton in
OL,9,FMarch this year.
